OL,3,GNEWSAConstruction begins on #112m
OL,4,ARolls-Royce facilities
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction work on new #112m
OL,7,Ffacilities at a Rolls-Royce centre in
OL,8,FDerby is under way.
OL,10,FOn Monday, the company announced a
OL,11,F#300m investment in the UK, including
OL,12,F#140m for Derby, with #112m allocated
OL,13,Fto a regeneration of the company's
OL,14,FSinfin A campus.
OL,16,FThe A Site will see six acres (2.4
OL,17,Fhectares) of old buildings and
OL,18,Finfrastructure cleared to make way for
OL,19,Ftwo new engineering and manufacturing
OL,20,Fservices facilities, which will employ
OL,21,Fmore than 300 people.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
