OL,3,GNEWSAConstruction begins on #112m
OL,4,ARolls-Royce facilities
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is the largest investment in
OL,7,FDerby in over a decade, and we are
OL,8,Freally proud of our ties with the city.
OL,9,FIt is a symbol of our commitment to
OL,10,FDerby," Paula Clarke, director of test
OL,11,Fand experimental engineering at
OL,12,FRolls-Royce, told the BBC.
